i.e., as the colimit of the corresponding diagram.\nGiven an inverse system <MATH_0017> over <MATH_0018> the limit\nof the inverse system <MATH_0019> is defined as\n<MATH_0020>\ni.e., as the limit of the corresponding diagram.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:71e4f65475061ca2a1f978ceb625abe9f4e0ccc66fa403608cb8db17bd558817", "unit_id": "tag:002Z:p004"}
